        <owl:annotatedTarget>The marker set ACTA2, TAGLN can identify the Human cell type tracheobronchial smooth muscle cell in the lung with a confidence of 0.69 (NS-Forest FBeta value).</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.11165918</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
    </owl:Axiom>
