        <obo:IAO_0000115>A transcriptomically distinct type of mesothelial fibroblast that is derived from the neural crest, is localized on blood vessels, and is a key component of the pia and arachnoid membranes surrounding the brain. The standard transcriptomic reference data for this cell type can be found on the CellxGene census under the collection: &apos;Transcriptomic cytoarchitecture reveals principles of human neocortex organization&apos;, dataset: &apos;Supercluster: Non-neuronal cells&apos;, Author Categories: &apos;CrossArea_subclass&apos;, clusters VLMC.</obo:IAO_0000115>
