        <obo:IAO_0000115>A fibroblast located in the lamina propria of the intestinal mucosa. This cell expresses PDGFRα and CD81 and is negative for α-smooth muscle actin (α-SMA). This cell is predominantly located in the small intestine adjacent to myofibroblasts surrounding the crypts. It is capable of synthesizing extracellular matrix components and structural proteins such as collagen and elastin.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">intestinal lamina propria fibroblast</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
