        <obo:IAO_0000028>CBX Golgi Gly-Gaba (Mmus)</obo:IAO_0000028>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A cerebellar Golgi cell of the Mus musculus brain. It is distinguished from other cells in the brain by selective expression of Zfp385c (Mmus), Tfap2b (Mmus). Reference transcriptomic data for this type can be found in the dataset/taxonomy - Yao et al. (2023), Whole Mouse Brain in cell set Supertype:1148 CBX Golgi Gly-Gaba_1.</obo:IAO_0000115>
