        <obo:IAO_0000115>The process in which the anatomical structures of the neural plate are generated and organized. The neural plate is a specialized region of columnar epithelial cells in the dorsal ectoderm that will give rise to nervous system tissue.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <rdfs:label>neural plate morphogenesis</rdfs:label>
