        <obo:IAO_0000115>The process whose specific outcome is the progression of the lens over time, from its formation to the mature structure. The lens is a transparent structure in the eye through which light is focused onto the retina. An example of this process is found in Mus musculus.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>lens development</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>lens development in camera-style eye</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <rdfs:label>lens development in camera-type eye</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
