        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0032501"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A multicellular organismal process carried out by any of the organs or tissues in an organ system. An organ system is a regularly interacting or interdependent group of organs or tissues that work together to carry out a biological objective.</obo:IAO_0000115>
