        <obo:IAO_0000115>A type of extracellular matrix found in interstitial connective tissue, characterized by the presence of fibronectins, proteoglycans, and types I, III, V, VI, VII and XII collagens.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <rdfs:label>interstitial matrix</rdfs:label>
