        <obo:IAO_0000115>Any process that decreases the rate, frequency or extent of neuron projection development. Neuron projection development is the process whose specific outcome is the progression of a neuron projection over time, from its formation to the mature structure. A neuron projection is any process extending from a neural cell, such as axons or dendrites (collectively called neurites).</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <rdfs:label>negative regulation of neuron projection development</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    <owl:Axiom>
