        <obo:IAO_0000115>The process whose specific outcome is the progression of the pons over time, from its formation to the mature structure. The pons lies above the medulla and next to the cerebellum. The pons conveys information about movement from the cerebral hemisphere to the cerebellum.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <rdfs:label>pons development</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
