        <obo:IAO_0000115>The process in which neuroblasts acquire specialized structural and/or functional features that characterize the mature cerebellar Golgi cell. Differentiation includes the processes involved in commitment of a neuroblast to a Golgi cell fate. A cerebellar Golgi cell is an inhibitory GABAergic interneuron found in the cerebellar cortex.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <rdfs:label>cerebellar Golgi cell differentiation</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
