        <obo:IAO_0000115>Any process that activates or increases the rate or extent of B cell proliferation.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>positive regulation of B lymphocyte proliferation</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>positive regulation of B-cell proliferation</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
