        <obo:IAO_0000115>Any process that results in a change in state or activity of a cell or an organism (in terms of movement, secretion, enzyme production, gene expression, etc.) as a result of a stimulus reflecting a decline in the level of oxygen.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>response to lowered oxygen levels</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <rdfs:comment>This term should be used when a decrease in oxygen levels is not considered a stress response. For a hypoxic stress response, consider instead &apos;response to hypoxia ; GO:0001666&apos;.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>response to decreased oxygen levels</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
