        <owl:annotatedTarget>A specialized area of membrane facing the presynaptic membrane on the tip of the nerve ending and separated from it by a minute cleft (the synaptic cleft). Neurotransmitters cross the synaptic cleft and transmit the signal to the postsynaptic membrane.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>ISBN:0198506732</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
    </owl:Axiom>
    


