        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>The process in which the anatomical structures of branches in a nerve are generated and organized. This term refers to an anatomical structure (nerve) not a cell (neuron).</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <rdfs:label>branching morphogenesis of a nerve</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
