            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>The series of events in which a light stimulus is received by a cell and converted into a molecular signal as part of the sensory perception of light.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>sensory detection of light stimulus</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>sensory detection of light stimulus during sensory perception</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>sensory perception, sensory detection of light stimulus</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
