            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>The process in which a relatively unspecialized cell acquires specialized features of a smooth muscle cell; smooth muscle lacks transverse striations in its constituent fibers and are almost always involuntary.</obo:IAO_0000115>
