        <obo:IAO_0000115>The biological process whose specific outcome is the progression of a lung lobe from an initial condition to its mature state. This process begins with the formation of a lung lobe by branching morphogenesis and ends with the mature structure. A lung lobe is one of the rounded projections that compose the lung.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <rdfs:label>lung lobe development</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
