        <obo:IAO_0000115>The process in which a relatively unspecialized cell acquires the specialized features of a hepatocyte. A hepatocyte is specialized epithelial cell that is organized into interconnected plates called lobules, and is the main structural component of the liver.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>liver cell differentiation</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <rdfs:label>hepatocyte differentiation</rdfs:label>
