        <obo:IAO_0000115>Any process that stops, prevents or reduces the frequency, rate or extent of enteroendocrine cell differentiation.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <rdfs:label>negative regulation of enteroendocrine cell differentiation</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
