        <owl:annotatedTarget>A rhodopsin-like G-protein coupled receptor that is a translation product of the human RXFP1 to RXFP4 genes, 1:1 orthologs thereof, or a semi-ortholog thereof. The active form binds relaxins.</owl:annotatedTarget>
