        <owl:annotatedTarget>A collection of brainstem nuclei that functions in multiple aspects of hearing and is an important component of the ascending and descending auditory pathways of the auditory system.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>ISBN:0-19-502694-2</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>Wikipedia:Superior_olivary_complex</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
